us acuta","license":"CC0"},"t":[95]},{"id":"w244789179","name":"神奈川県立近代美術館葉山","lat":35.26499,"lon":139.57665,"cat":"museum","indoor":true,"f":["toilets","indoor"],"kid":0.75,"nov":0.57,"rich":0.95,"apl":1,"city":"葉山町","hours":"Tu-Su 09:30-17:00","web":"https://www.moma.pref.kanagawa.jp/","wd":"Q11589187","desc":"神奈川県葉山町と鎌倉市にある美術館","wp":{"title":"神奈川県立近代美術館","extract":"神奈川県立近代美術館（かながわけんりつきんだいびじゅつかん）は、神奈川県にある日本最古の公立近代美術館。1951年に鎌倉市雪ノ下に開館し、のちに鎌倉館となったが2016年（平成28年）3月31日に鎌倉館は閉館。以後は葉山館（2003年開館、葉山町）と鎌倉別館（1984年開館、鎌倉市）からなる。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/The_Museum_of_Modern_Art%2C_Kamakura_2009.jpg/960px-The_Museum_of_Modern_Art%2C_Kamakura_2009.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Museum_of_Modern_Art,_Kamakura_2009.jpg","artist":"Wiiii","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},"vis":29,"t":[92]},{"id":"w832490593","name":"はやま三ヵ岡山緑地","lat":35.26799,"lon":139.57799,"cat":"park","indoor":false,"f":["large","free"],"kid":0.65,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":1,"ha":39.9,"city":"葉山町","t":[95,93]},{"id":"w1305014037","name":"葉山しおさい公園","lat":35.26427,"lon":139.57788,"cat":"park","indoor":false,"f":["toilets"],"kid":0.65,"nov":0.61,"rich":0.5,"apl":0.4,"city":"葉山町","hours":"Mo off; Tu-Su 08:30-17:00","vis":23,"t":[95]},{"id":"w592315707","name":"公園","lat":35.27458,"lon":139.57398,"cat":"park","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.65,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":0.12,"city":"葉山町","t":[95]},{"id":"w452990512","name":"花の木公園","lat":35.27124,"lon":139.58578,"cat":"park","indoor":false,"f":["toilets","free"],"kid":0.7,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":0.4,"city":"葉山町","t":[95,55]},{"id":"w53752261","name":"逗子海岸","lat":35.29104,"lon":139.57117,"cat":"water","indoor":false,"f":["toilets","free"],"kid":0.9,"nov":0.26,"rich":0.85,"apl":1,"city":"逗子市","wd":"Q11639497","desc":"神奈川県逗子市の海岸","wp":{"title":"逗子海岸","extract":"逗子海岸（ずしかいがん）は、神奈川県逗子市新宿に位置する相模湾に面した海岸である。逗子海水浴場として知られる。新宿海岸、新宿浜、東郷浜とも呼ばれてい